(i) "cross-border money transfer service" means either of the following services:
i. accepting money from a person in IFSC, whether as principal or agent, for the purpose of transmitting, or arranging for
the transmission of, the money to any person outside IFSC;
ii. receiving money from a person outside IFSC or arranging for the receipt of money from a person outside IFSC
