(ac) "payment transaction" means the act of placing, transfer or withdrawal of money, whether for the purpose of paying
for goods or services or for any other purpose, with or without any underlying obligations between the payer and payee;
(ad) "regular payment service provider" means a Payment Service Provider, authorised under regulation 10 of these
regulations, other than significant payment service provider;
(ae) "safeguarding institution" means an IFSC Banking Unit ('IBU') or an IFSC Banking Company ('IBC'), as defined in
